### GET all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

###

### GET one contact by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/69fff7346a05c47b346981e2

###

### POST create a new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alex",
  "lastName": "Richardson",
  "email": "alex@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Red",
  "birthday": "1998-05-16"
}

###

### PUT update an existing contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/69fff7346a05c47b346981e2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alex",
  "lastName": "Richardson",
  "email": "alex.updated@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "Red",
  "birthday": "1998-05-16"
}

###

### DELETE remove a contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/69fff7346a05c47b346981e2
